[
  {
    "id": "S-1",
    "text": "我不够好，周围的人都比我优秀。",
    "dimension": "S1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-2",
    "text": "外人的评价对我来说无所吊谓。",
    "dimension": "S1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-3",
    "text": "我很清楚真正的自己是什么样的。",
    "dimension": "S2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-4",
    "text": "被问「你是什么样的人」时——",
    "dimension": "S2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-5",
    "text": "我内心有真正追求的东西。",
    "dimension": "S3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-6",
    "text": "我一定要不断往上爬、变得更厉害。",
    "dimension": "S3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-7",
    "text": "对象超过5小时没回消息，说自己窜稀了，你会怎么想？",
    "dimension": "E1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-8",
    "text": "我在感情里经常担心被对方抛弃。",
    "dimension": "E1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-9",
    "text": "我对天发誓，我对待每一份感情都是认真的！",
    "dimension": "E2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-10",
    "text": "你的恋爱对象是一个尊老爱幼、温柔敦厚、洁身自好、玉树临风/国色天香的人，此时你会？",
    "dimension": "E2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-11",
    "text": "恋爱后，对象非常黏人，你作何感想？",
    "dimension": "E3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-12",
    "text": "我在任何关系里都很重视个人空间。",
    "dimension": "E3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-13",
    "text": "大多数人是善良的。",
    "dimension": "A1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-14",
    "text": "你走在街上，一位萌萌的小女孩递给你一根棒棒糖，此时你作何感想？",
    "dimension": "A1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-15",
    "text": "快考试了，学校规定必须上晚自习，请假会扣分，但今晚你约了男/女神一起玩《绝地求生》，你怎么办？",
    "dimension": "A2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-16",
    "text": "我做事常常有计划，____",
    "dimension": "A2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-17",
    "text": "突然某一天，我意识到人生哪有什么意义，人不过跟动物一样被各种欲望支配着，纯纯被激素控制的东西。",
    "dimension": "A3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-18",
    "text": "我觉得人活着总得有点为之奋斗的东西。",
    "dimension": "A3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-19",
    "text": "我做事主要为了取得成果和进步，而不是避免麻烦和风险。",
    "dimension": "Ac1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-20",
    "text": "看到别人做得好，你的第一反应是？",
    "dimension": "Ac1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-21",
    "text": "做决定的时候——",
    "dimension": "Ac2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-22",
    "text": "此题没有题目，请盲选。",
    "dimension": "Ac2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-23",
    "text": "别人说你\"执行力强\"，你内心更接近哪句？",
    "dimension": "Ac3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-24",
    "text": "你因便秘坐在马桶上已长达30分钟，拉不出来很难受，此时你更像——",
    "dimension": "Ac3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-25",
    "text": "朋友带了 ta 的朋友一起来玩，你最可能的状态是？",
    "dimension": "So1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-26",
    "text": "你因玩《第五人格》而结识许多网友，并被邀请线下见面，你的想法是？",
    "dimension": "So1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-27",
    "text": "我和人相处主打一个电子围栏，靠太近会自动报警。",
    "dimension": "So2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-28",
    "text": "我渴望和我信任的人关系密切，熟得像失散多年的亲戚。",
    "dimension": "So2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-29",
    "text": "我在不同人面前会表现出不一样的自己。",
    "dimension": "So3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-30",
    "text": "有时候你对一件事有不同的、负面的看法，但最后没说出来。多数情况下原因是：",
    "dimension": "So3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-33",
    "text": "拍了一张自拍，你的下一步操作是？",
    "dimension": "S1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-34",
    "text": "朋友说\"你今天状态不太好\"，你内心：",
    "dimension": "S1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-35",
    "text": "如果有人给你贴了一个你完全不认同的标签，你会？",
    "dimension": "S2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-36",
    "text": "你能清楚说出\"什么事会让你真的生气\"吗？",
    "dimension": "S2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-37",
    "text": "身边的人都在\"整顿职场/考公/润\"你的第一反应是？",
    "dimension": "S3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-38",
    "text": "你有没有那种\"为了它可以放弃其他东西\"的执念？",
    "dimension": "S3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-39",
    "text": "恋人突然说\"我跟你说个事\"，你的心率变化：",
    "dimension": "E1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-40",
    "text": "你的好朋友最近和另一个人走得很近，你：",
    "dimension": "E1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-41",
    "text": "喜欢上一个人之后，你手机的使用方式会？",
    "dimension": "E2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-42",
    "text": "正在追的剧大结局/喜欢的偶像塌房，你的反应是？",
    "dimension": "E2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-43",
    "text": "对象想跟你共享手机密码/定位，你觉得：",
    "dimension": "E3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-44",
    "text": "一个人吃火锅你觉得：",
    "dimension": "E3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-45",
    "text": "网上看到\"好人有好报\"的故事，你的反应是？",
    "dimension": "A1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-46",
    "text": "陌生人突然对你微笑，你的第一反应：",
    "dimension": "A1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-47",
    "text": "排队等餐，有人插队，你会？",
    "dimension": "A2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-48",
    "text": "你桌面的文件夹命名风格最接近：",
    "dimension": "A2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-49",
    "text": "如果突然多了一百万，你最可能：",
    "dimension": "A3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-50",
    "text": "\"你五年后想成为什么样的人？\"你的回答：",
    "dimension": "A3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-51",
    "text": "游戏里你更喜欢哪种玩法？",
    "dimension": "Ac1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-52",
    "text": "看到\"限时挑战/打卡活动\"，你：",
    "dimension": "Ac1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-53",
    "text": "点外卖的时候你一般花多长时间选？",
    "dimension": "Ac2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-54",
    "text": "后悔上一秒做的决定，你的操作是？",
    "dimension": "Ac2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-55",
    "text": "你的\"明天再做\"承诺兑现率大概是：",
    "dimension": "Ac3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-56",
    "text": "列了一个to-do list，到晚上你大概率：",
    "dimension": "Ac3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-57",
    "text": "到了一个谁都不认识的新环境，你：",
    "dimension": "So1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-58",
    "text": "一个月没联系的朋友突然找你出来吃饭，你：",
    "dimension": "So1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-59",
    "text": "刚认识的人热情地给你一个拥抱，你的身体反应：",
    "dimension": "So2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-60",
    "text": "朋友未经允许翻你手机，你：",
    "dimension": "So2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-61",
    "text": "线上聊天的你和线下面对面的你，别人的评价是？",
    "dimension": "So3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-62",
    "text": "你不喜欢一个人但对方对你很热情，你：",
    "dimension": "So3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-63",
    "text": "看到别人的成就时，我经常觉得自己啥也不是。",
    "dimension": "S1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-64",
    "text": "如果让你上台即兴发言一分钟，你：",
    "dimension": "S1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-65",
    "text": "我经常觉得自己的想法前后矛盾、不太一致。",
    "dimension": "S2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-66",
    "text": "问我\"你到底想要什么\"，我往往答不上来。",
    "dimension": "S2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-67",
    "text": "别人问我\"你这辈子最想做什么\"，我其实没有答案。",
    "dimension": "S3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-68",
    "text": "我觉得什么事情都差不多，没什么值得特别认真对待的。",
    "dimension": "S3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-69",
    "text": "我总觉得自己不够好，配不上现在的关系。",
    "dimension": "E1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-70",
    "text": "即使吵了架，你依然相信这段关系不会因此结束。",
    "dimension": "E1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-71",
    "text": "在感情里我很难做到全身心投入，总会给自己留退路。",
    "dimension": "E2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-72",
    "text": "朋友说\"你对感情太冷淡了\"，你觉得？",
    "dimension": "E2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-73",
    "text": "我离开一个人就会很焦虑，需要不断确认对方还在。",
    "dimension": "E3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-74",
    "text": "和亲密的人一整天待在一起，到晚上你：",
    "dimension": "E3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-75",
    "text": "做好事不留名？算了吧，这年头好人都没好报。",
    "dimension": "A1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-76",
    "text": "我觉得大部分人心里都在算计，真心话很少。",
    "dimension": "A1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-77",
    "text": "规矩是死的人是活的，我觉得灵活变通比死守规则更重要。",
    "dimension": "A2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-78",
    "text": "旅行时你更倾向于：",
    "dimension": "A2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-79",
    "text": "说实话我不太理解那些\"为梦想拼命\"的人，活着不累吗？",
    "dimension": "A3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-80",
    "text": "你觉得自己的存在对这个世界有什么特别的意义吗？",
    "dimension": "A3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-81",
    "text": "领导说\"这个项目你来带\"，你心里第一反应：",
    "dimension": "Ac1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-82",
    "text": "比起获得成功，我更怕的是犯错误和丢人。",
    "dimension": "Ac1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-83",
    "text": "我经常在做完决定之后反复回想\"要是当时选另一个就好了\"。",
    "dimension": "Ac2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-84",
    "text": "面对二选一的时候，我会纠结到失去两个选项。",
    "dimension": "Ac2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-85",
    "text": "我是那种\"想法非常多但实际做出来的很少\"的人。",
    "dimension": "Ac3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-86",
    "text": "DDL（deadline）是什么？是让你动起来的唯一力量。",
    "dimension": "Ac3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-87",
    "text": "能不出门就不出门，能不社交就不社交。",
    "dimension": "So1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-88",
    "text": "对我来说，独处比社交消耗更少的能量。",
    "dimension": "So1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-89",
    "text": "我很享受那种跟谁都\"表面熟\"但其实谁也进不来的状态。",
    "dimension": "So2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-90",
    "text": "有人说你\"冷漠\"或\"有距离感\"，你觉得：",
    "dimension": "So2",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-31",
    "text": "您平时有什么爱好？",
    "dimension": "S1",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  },
  {
    "id": "S-32",
    "text": "喝了酒之后，我会变成完全不同的一个人。",
    "dimension": "So3",
    "source": "src/lib/questions.ts"
  }
]